
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Nebula — Crystal Works</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

html{scroll-behavior:smooth}

body{
    font-family:Inter,sans-serif;
    background:#050509;
    color:#fff;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

body::before{
    content:"";
    position:fixed;
    width:600px;
    height:600px;
    background:#7c3aed;
    filter:blur(180px);
    opacity:.22;
    top:-250px;
    left:-200px;
    pointer-events:none;
}

body::after{
    content:"";
    position:fixed;
    width:500px;
    height:500px;
    background:#2563eb;
    filter:blur(180px);
    opacity:.18;
    right:-200px;
    bottom:-200px;
    pointer-events:none;
}

nav{
    width:min(1100px,92%);
    margin:20px auto;
    padding:14px 18px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
    border-radius:18px;
    position:relative;
    z-index:5;
}

.logo{
    font-size:19px;
    font-weight:800;
}

.logo span{color:#8b5cf6}

.links{
    display:flex;
    gap:25px;
}

.links a{
    color:#aaa;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:14px;
    transition:.2s;
}

.links a:hover{color:white}

.menu{
    display:none;
    font-size:24px;
    cursor:pointer;
}

.hero{
    min-height:82vh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:80px 20px;
}

.hero-content{max-width:850px}

.badge{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:8px 14px;
    border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.4);
    background:rgba(139,92,246,.1);
    border-radius:999px;
    color:#c4b5fd;
    font-size:13px;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

h1{
    font-size:clamp(48px,9vw,100px);
    line-height:.95;
    letter-spacing:-5px;
}

h1 span{
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#a78bfa,#60a5fa);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;
    color:transparent;
}

.hero p{
    max-width:620px;
    margin:28px auto;
    color:#999;
    line-height:1.7;
    font-size:17px;
}

.buttons{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:12px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.btn{
    padding:14px 22px;
    border-radius:12px;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:14px;
}

.primary{
    color:white;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed,#2563eb);
    box-shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(99,102,241,.3);
}

.secondary{
    color:#ddd;
    border:1px solid #292929;
    background:#111;
}

section{
    width:min(1100px,92%);
    margin:0 auto 100px;
}

.cards{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:16px;
}

.card{
    padding:30px;
    min-height:220px;
    border:1px solid #202024;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);
    border-radius:22px;
    transition:.3s;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-6px);
    border-color:#4c1d95;
    background:rgba(124,58,237,.08);
}

.icon{
    width:45px;
    height:45px;
    border-radius:13px;
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;
    background:#18111f;
    color:#a78bfa;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

.card h3{margin-bottom:10px}

.card p{
    color:#888;
    line-height:1.6;
    font-size:14px;
}

footer{
    border-top:1px solid #18181b;
    padding:30px;
    text-align:center;
    color:#666;
    font-size:13px;
}

@media(max-width:700px){
    .links{
        display:none;
        position:absolute;
        top:65px;
        left:0;
        width:100%;
        padding:20px;
        flex-direction:column;
        background:#0b0b0f;
        border:1px solid #222;
        border-radius:15px;
    }

    .links.active{display:flex}

    .menu{display:block}

    .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}

    h1{letter-spacing:-3px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
    <div class="logo">Crystal<span>Works</span></div>

    <div class="links" id="links">
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#work">Work</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
    </div>

    <div class="menu" onclick="toggleMenu()">☰</div>
</nav>

<main id="home">

<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-content">

<div class="badge">✦ DIGITAL EXPERIENCES</div>

<h1>Build beyond<br><span>ordinary.</span></h1>

<p>
We create immersive digital experiences, modern interfaces,
and ambitious products designed for the next generation.
</p>

<div class="buttons">
<a class="btn primary" href="#work">Explore Work</a>
<a class="btn secondary" href="#about">About Us</a>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section id="work">
<div class="cards">

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">✦</div>
<h3>Creative Systems</h3>
<p>Distinctive visual systems designed to make digital products memorable.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">◈</div>
<h3>Modern Interfaces</h3>
<p>Responsive interfaces built around clarity, motion and usability.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="icon">⌁</div>
<h3>Digital Products</h3>
<p>From concept to launch, we turn ambitious ideas into real products.</p>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section id="about">
<div class="card">
<h3>Crystal Works Studios</h3>
<br>
<p>
A digital studio focused on design, technology and experimentation.
We believe great websites should feel as good as they look.
</p>
</div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
© 2026 Crystal Works Studios
</footer>

<script>
function toggleMenu(){
    document.getElementById("links").classList.toggle("active");
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
```
